  "state_summary": "Seed 6101, round 3 has 429 observed records, 2901 eligible candidates, no pending records, and no validation or test truth. The latest measured feedback rejects several continuation curves that were selected from prior hypotheses. Nitrogen corrections overextended to m90 and m211, while amino-ketone m36 was substantially underpredicted. Hydroxyl and hydroxy-ether response growth was again missed. The current errors are graph-by-eluent and endpoint-specific; they do not support a universal correction.",
  "important_model_behaviors": [
    {
      "evidence_type": "observed measured evidence",
      "behavior": "The predicted steep nitrogen response was too large for pyridyl ester m90 and phenylpyridine m211. m90 at 5/1 measured 27.48/65.41 versus 46.45/106.71 predicted; m211 measured 11.61/19.38 at 5/1 and 18.13/30.88 at 10/1 versus 20.42/34.37 and 36.26/60.31 predicted.",
