    "Sparse ratio coverage leaves the model vulnerable to overconfident extrapolation after adaptive retraining. Recent m90, m211, m99, m120 and m124 outcomes show both over- and under-correction.",
    "Loading amount, loading solvent and plug volume appear weakly represented. Inspect feature scaling, condition encoding, interaction layers, and output transformations using observed-only grouped diagnostics.",
